@ 2023.06.27
[gcc/boost - default version]

You must install the belows.
- CAENUSBdrvB-1.5.2 
- CAENVMELib-2.50
- CAENComm-1.2
- CAENDigitizer_2.11.0
These have "Readme" files which describe the installation.

In this directory(ADC_test), 
execute :	make
test run :	./adc

calibration run1 (external trigger):
	./adc -c 00000011 -o directory/file_name -r -n 50000 -d 1000 -p 25 -s 55240 -t 3000
	./adc -c(hannel) (which channels among 8 channels) -o directory/file_name -r(oot_file) -n (event number) -d (point number for waveform) -p (post trigger) -s (offset) -t (trigger value)

calibration run2 (self trigger):
	./adc -c 00000001 -o directory/file_name -r -n 50000 -d 1000 -p 20 -s 7050 -t 14950 -f 

-f option is for the falling edge!

